msgstr "Une scriture tal indiç des traduzions e je lade in conflit cuntune altre richieste ai %1$s (%2$s) e no je stade aplicade; e je stade mantignude la version plui recente."

#. translators: 1: when the write failed, 2: which part of the index it was for, 3: a short technical reason code.
